      "id": "claim_20bc2329d2b3460a862dd77685bd6369",
      "statement": "The shared BrijioBackgroundController gates only submit_form, fetch_resource, and download_file for client-side approval via getApprovalActionType, and calls ensureApprovedAction (which uses ApprovalAdapter.requestApproval) before executing those actions; all other action types execute without approval.",
