      "statement": "ApprovalAdapter is the platform-injected contract with getActiveOrigin, requestApproval, and hideApproval; the controller receives it via BrijioBackgroundControllerOptions.approval with an approvalTimeoutMs default of 55000, and returns approval_unavailable when the adapter or active origin is missing.",
